{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方最大号的白色粗体问句首先入眼，随后中下方两块同样醒目的粗体文字争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他开始担心对方有一天不再需要自己的陪伴，甚至不愿意和自己待在一起。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、担忧，隐约害怕被对方拒绝。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他因此突然安静下来，不敢继续往下想；后来想起两人仍然亲近，才感到一点高兴。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块大号粗体文字都很醒目，存在多个主视线入口。\",\n    \"标题与下方两块文字分别呈现担忧、突然安静和重新获得一点高兴，完整的当下状态需要跨块拼接。\",\n    \"单块文字较长，内部包含多个层次的意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "35481c27-92ec-41c5-81a1-7d6b0e9659c4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030149531823Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:02:13.965039+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "254dc282d04cf6c5777e3bd95904ab6653840021c93e4cb2e57bfe81065ba2b0", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238